sequenceDiagram
    %% Interaction_Trace.mmd
    %% End-to-end user transaction trace via the BFF boundary.
    %% Component.razor -> Resilient Typed HttpClient -> BFF Cookie Verification
    %% -> Minimal API Feature Handler -> Table Storage Execution.

    autonumber
    actor User as Player (mobile)
    participant Page as Game Page Component
    participant Http as Resilient Typed HttpClient
    participant Cookie as DevCookie HttpOnly
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware OIDC prod
    participant API as Minimal API Feature Handler
    participant Repo as Slice Repository
    participant Table as Azure Table Storage
    participant TLogs as OpenTelemetry App Insights
    participant Logs as Serilog source-gen events

    User->>Page: Tap "Submit score"
    Page->>Page: Optimistic UI update (local toast)
    Page->>Http: POST /api/poracer/scores
    Note over Http: Standard resilience: retry x3 + exp backoff + breaker
    Http->>Cookie: Attach Bearer or DevCookie
    Http->>Auth: HTTP request hits host
    Auth->>Auth: Authorize attribute check

    alt Authenticated
        Auth->>API: forward to handler
        API->>API: Bind PoRacerScoreDto (System.Text.Json)
        API->>API: Handler validation (TotalTime 1..3600, Position 1..8)

        alt validation fails
            API-->>Http: 400 ValidationProblem errors
            Http-->>Page: per-field validation
            Page-->>User: inline form errors
        else valid
            API->>API: Coerce PlayerDisplayName from auth claims (anti-spoof)
            API->>API: Cooldown check (lastSubmitByUser, at least 30s)
            API->>Repo: SaveHighScoreAsync(dto, userId)
            Repo->>Table: Upsert TableEntity (PK=poracer, RK=SHA-256(dto))
            Table-->>Repo: 204 with ETag
            Repo-->>API: Upsert result
            API-->>Http: 204 NoContent
            Http-->>Page: 204
            Page->>Page: Update local state + leaderboard cache
            Page-->>User: "Score saved" toast
        end
    else Unauthenticated
        Auth-->>Http: 401 Unauthorized
        Http-->>Page: 401
        Page->>Auth: GET /api/auth/handshake
        Auth-->>Page: AuthState (anonymous, oauthConfigured)
        Page-->>User: render LoginScreen
    end

    Note over Logs,TLogs: Every step emits source-gen LoggerMessage event and OTel span
    API->>Logs: emit "Score accepted" event
    API->>TLogs: trace "poracer.submit"
    Auth->>TLogs: dependency "aztables.upsert"
    Auth->>Logs: emit "Auth challenge" if anon